From: nydal91 <nydal91@hotmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 13:22:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 01/18] Add ARM64EC build support for Proton/Wine ARM64

Add Release and ReleaseDebug ARM64EC configurations, Windows build
scripts for OptiScaler and its dependencies, and Proton install tooling
and documentation.

Treat swapchains created through winevulkan.dll as DXGI backed when a
D3D device has been captured. Wine's thunk layer hides the real DXVK or
vkd3d-proton caller, and doing Vulkan-only work on those swapchains can
deadlock inside Wine.

Ship the ini with the overlay on the O key and file logging enabled, and
include the unordered_dense submodule change as a patch file because
this repository cannot record it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01A9WqnwGsLAcGJXd49N2pes
